{
  "name": "MedFlow — Physical Check-In (template)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TEMPLATE ONLY — no secrets in this file\n\n**Do not** commit real API keys, tokens, phone numbers, or patient data.\n\nConfigure in n8n **Settings → Variables** (placeholders):\n- `MEDFLOW_API_BASE_URL` — e.g. http://localhost:3000\n- `MEDFLOW_WEBHOOK_SECRET` — match MedFlow WEBHOOK_SECRET\n- `MEDFLOW_TEST_MODE` — default `true` (no live traffic)\n\nCarrier credential **names** (create in n8n Credentials, then set IDs):\n- `TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID`\n- `EMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID`\n- `VAPI_CREDENTIAL_ID`\n- `OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID`\n- `GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID`\n\nSet `MEDFLOW_TEST_MODE=false` only after all credentials are configured manually. Until then, workflows return dry-run responses and **do not** place calls, SMS, or email.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c162e9cb-6b6d-4af5-8287-44e69a75d918",
      "name": "Safety — Template Only",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MedFlow — Physical Check-In\n\nCheck-in → appointment status template.\n\n**Webhook path:** `medflow/physical-check-in`\n**MedFlow env (outbound from MedFlow):** `N8N_WEBHOOK_CHECK_IN`\n**Callback:** `POST /api/webhooks/appointment`\n\nKiosk/form → n8n → MedFlow appointment webhook.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "93691993-42ed-4ac4-b4f5-27561ec673a5",
      "name": "Workflow Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Carrier nodes (add manually)\n\nThis template does **not** send real traffic.\n\nWhen `MEDFLOW_TEST_MODE=false`, wire carrier nodes using n8n credential IDs:\n\n**This workflow:** \n\nPlaceholders: TWILIO_CREDENTIAL_ID, EMAIL_CREDENTIAL_ID, VAPI_CREDENTIAL_ID, OPENAI_CREDENTIAL_ID, GOOGLE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "ee1692bb-5dbf-4cf0-b3b8-1fc2018c6e74",
